WEBVTT

00:07:28.333 --> 00:07:30.768
our votes and our support

00:07:30.792 --> 00:07:33.434
to giving them the resources
that they will need

00:07:33.458 --> 00:07:35.643
not just to survive

00:07:35.667 --> 00:07:37.143
but hopefully thrive,

00:07:37.167 --> 00:07:40.226
allowing all of us to do so as well.

00:07:40.250 --> 00:07:41.518
Thank you.

00:07:41.542 --> 00:07:44.833
(Applause and cheers)